BUNDLED MII STRUCTUREDEFINITION PROFILES — CC-BY-4.0

The JSON files under src/quality/profiles/extensions/ are derived from
the Medizininformatik-Initiative (MII) Kerndatensatz FHIR Implementation
Guides and are licensed under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International (CC-BY-4.0). The original profiles are (c) their respective
authors. See src/quality/profiles/extensions/ATTRIBUTION.md for per-package
attribution, canonical URLs, and bundled versions.

Modifications from the original packages: trimmed to the subset of
StructureDefinition fields used by the FHIR Exploder completeness walker
({ url, name, type, snapshot.element[{ path, min, max, mustSupport,
sliceName, type, required-binding }] }). No semantic changes to the
profile definitions themselves.

The FHIR Exploder source code (everything NOT under
src/quality/profiles/extensions/) remains MIT-licensed per the body of
this file above.

