================================================================
HL7 IPS Composition profile (HL7 International)

This repository bundles the HL7 International Patient Summary (IPS)
Composition profile (package `hl7.fhir.uv.ips`) under the directory
`src/quality/profiles/ips/`. The bundled profile is a TRIMMED derivative
of the upstream package (snapshot.element[] reduced to { path, min,
max, mustSupport, sliceName, type, required-binding }) — no semantic
changes to the profile definitions themselves.

The HL7 IPS package ships under the **CC0-1.0** Public Domain
Dedication. No attribution is legally required, but provenance is
recorded here as good practice.

  Package:        hl7.fhir.uv.ips
  Bundled version: 2.0.0
  Canonical URL:  http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/ips
  License:        CC0-1.0
  Source:         https://packages.fhir.org/hl7.fhir.uv.ips

The FHIR Exploder source code (everything NOT under
src/quality/profiles/ips/ and NOT under src/quality/profiles/extensions/)
remains MIT-licensed per the body of this file above.

License text:
  CC0-1.0: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode
